WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:01.434 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Recently, Former First Lady
Melania Trump

00:00:01.434 --> 00:00:04.404 align:start size:94% position:6%
announced she is opening
the Office of Melania Trump.

00:00:04.404 --> 00:00:08.141 align:start size:94% position:6%
Here to talk about it,
please welcome Melania Trump

00:00:08.141 --> 00:00:14.214 align:start size:94% position:6%
-[ Falsetto ]
Awwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwww

00:00:14.214 --> 00:00:15.949 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Foreign accent ]
Hello! Greetings to you.

00:00:15.949 --> 00:00:18.084 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Okay, right off the bat,
because I know

00:00:18.084 --> 00:00:20.887 size:88% position:44%
people have talked about
look-alikes and whatnot.

00:00:20.887 --> 00:00:23.790 size:84% position:42%
I have to ask, are you
the real Melania Trump?

00:00:23.790 --> 00:00:27.861 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I'm as real as
the Office of Melania Trump.

00:00:27.861 --> 00:00:29.496 line:92%
-Yeah, so, about your office

00:00:29.496 --> 00:00:31.431 line:92%
What is it that you do there

00:00:31.431 --> 00:00:33.099 align:start size:94% position:6%
-[ Gasps ]
What don't we do?

00:00:33.099 --> 00:00:37.137 align:start size:94% position:6%
At the Office of Melania Trump
we work tirelessly

00:00:37.137 --> 00:00:38.905 size:84% position:42% line:92%
1 to 1 1/2 days a week.

00:00:38.905 --> 00:00:42.475 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Okay but what does the
Office of Melania Trump do

00:00:42.475 --> 00:00:46.212 align:start size:94% position:6%
-"But what does the
Office of Melania Trump do?"

00:00:46.212 --> 00:00:47.580 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
you may be asking.

00:00:47.580 --> 00:00:49.049 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-I just asked that.

00:00:49.049 --> 00:00:50.984 line:92%
-Do they do consulting work?

00:00:50.984 --> 00:00:51.684 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Accounting?

00:00:51.684 --> 00:00:53.553 line:92%
Can they represent me in court

00:00:53.553 --> 00:00:55.688 line:92%
The answer to that question is

00:00:55.688 --> 00:00:57.457 line:92%
how much money do you have

00:00:57.457 --> 00:00:59.426 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, but that's
not a answer.

00:00:59.426 --> 00:01:01.428 line:92%
-The Office of Melania Trump

00:01:01.428 --> 00:01:04.364 align:start size:94% position:6%
The only office
that will have you saying,

00:01:04.364 --> 00:01:06.232 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
"Where is it?"

00:01:06.232 --> 00:01:08.435 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Why would I need to know
where it is?

00:01:08.435 --> 00:01:10.703 align:start size:94% position:6%
-So you can
enjoy our services.

00:01:10.703 --> 00:01:12.138 size:84% position:42% line:92%
-Here we go. Which are?

00:01:12.138 --> 00:01:13.540 size:81% position:41% line:92%
-Thank you for asking.

00:01:13.540 --> 00:01:16.409 size:81% position:41% line:92%
We love our customers!

00:01:16.409 --> 00:01:18.778 size:88% position:44% line:92%
-Who are your customers?

00:01:18.778 --> 00:01:20.613 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-No one! Anyone!

00:01:20.613 --> 00:01:21.781 line:92%
The Office of Melania Trum

00:01:21.781 --> 00:01:24.584 align:start size:94% position:6%
welcomes people
of all types of person.

00:01:24.584 --> 00:01:27.987 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I need you to be more specifi
about what you do there.

00:01:27.987 --> 00:01:29.789 size:84% position:42% line:92%
-[ Gasps ] You need me?

00:01:29.789 --> 00:01:30.490 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Oh my God.

00:01:30.490 --> 00:01:34.127 align:start size:94% position:6%
-See, Seth, the answers
to your questions

00:01:34.127 --> 00:01:35.428 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
is in the wind.

00:01:35.428 --> 00:01:38.164 line:92%
It's in the smile of a child

00:01:38.164 --> 00:01:39.966 line:92%
It's in the laugh of a baby.

00:01:39.966 --> 00:01:43.970 align:start size:94% position:6%
The Office of Melania Trum
is in us all.

00:01:43.970 --> 00:01:45.105 align:start size:94% position:6%
-See, I thought
you'd be excited

00:01:45.105 --> 00:01:46.706 align:start size:94% position:6%
to finally be
out of the spotlight.

00:01:46.706 --> 00:01:49.209 align:start size:94% position:6%
Why would you start up
a business, anyway?

00:01:49.209 --> 00:01:49.909 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Whoa, whoa, whoa!

00:01:49.909 --> 00:01:51.878 align:start size:94% position:6%
No one said
we were a "business."

00:01:51.878 --> 00:01:54.681 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Then what is the
Office of Melania Trump?!

00:01:54.681 --> 00:01:58.384 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Here is a list
of the many things we offer.

00:01:58.384 --> 00:01:59.152 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Thank you.

00:01:59.152 --> 00:02:01.688 line:92%
-We offer tasks, checklists,

00:02:01.688 --> 00:02:05.191 align:start size:94% position:6%
a wide array
of verbs and nouns,

00:02:05.191 --> 00:02:06.426 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
this, that,

00:02:06.426 --> 00:02:08.728 line:92%
all of what is over there,

00:02:08.728 --> 00:02:10.396 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
every single stuff,

00:02:10.396 --> 00:02:11.531 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
that thing we do,

00:02:11.531 --> 00:02:14.200 line:92%
and, of course, our specialties.

00:02:14.200 --> 00:02:14.834 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
That's right!

00:02:14.834 --> 00:02:15.902 align:start size:94% position:6%
If you're looking
for some of it,

00:02:15.902 --> 00:02:19.572 align:start size:94% position:6%
we may just be what you're
listening to right now.

00:02:19.572 --> 00:02:21.875 line:92%
The Office of Melania Trump.

00:02:21.875 --> 00:02:24.210 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
It has walls!

00:02:24.210 --> 00:02:25.078 line:92%
-Melania Trump, everybody.

00:02:25.078 --> 00:02:27.080 align:start size:94% position:6%
We'll be right back
with Don Johnson.

00:02:27.080 --> 00:02:30.350 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I'll be right back
with myself!

